title: "VEHICLE-ODI: A Relational Decision Architecture for Orbital Debris Prioritization"
authors:
  - family-names: "Borda Milan"
    given-names: "Roberto"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-9047-1036"
version: "1.0.4"
date-released: "2026-05-07"
abstract: "VEHICLE-ODI is a relational decision architecture for orbital debris prioritization before intervention. It models debris, assets, orbital regions and uncertainty as a structured graph to support Orbital Tension Index analysis, A1-A6 regimes and supervised decision support."
keywords:
  - "orbital debris"
  - "space debris"
  - "space traffic management"
  - "orbital sustainability"
  - "decision architecture"
  - "relational systems"
  - "VEHICLE-ODI"
